msgid "Color:"
msgstr "色:"

#: ../src/ui/dialog/filter-effects-dialog.cpp:3203
msgid "The whole filter region will be filled with this color."
msgstr "フィルター領域全体はこの色で塗りつぶされます。"

#: ../src/ui/dialog/filter-effects-dialog.cpp:3207
msgid "The standard deviation for the blur operation."
msgstr "ぼかし操作の標準偏差です。"

#: ../src/ui/dialog/filter-effects-dialog.cpp:3213
msgid ""
"Erode: performs \"thinning\" of input image.\n"
"Dilate: performs \"fattening\" of input image."
msgstr ""
"腐食: 入力画像を \"細く\" します。\n"
"拡張: 入力画像を \"太く\" します。"

